<title>UK: Robert Fleming unit sets 100 mln stg perpetual.</title>
<headline>Robert Fleming unit sets 100 mln stg perpetual.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated</p>
<p>perpetual callable bond was announced by joint lead managers</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch International and Salomon Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ROBERT FLEMING CAPITAL LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ROBERT FLEMING AND CO</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    14.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+120 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED LATER.</p>
<p>		CALL AT PAR AFTER 10 YEARS.</p>
<p>		COUPON WILL BE RESET AT 2007 CALL TO YIELD FIVE-YEAR</p>
<p>		GILTS +220 BP. CALLABLE EVERY FIVE YEARS THEREAFTER.</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.25 PCT GILT DUE 2007 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
